{"id":"5d15e66fdc836d19","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-reed-solomon-code.md","title":"Reed Solomon Evaluation Encoding","display":"df-reed-solomon-code — Reed Solomon Evaluation Encoding","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-reed-solomon-code","aliases":["28-df-reed-solomon-code"],"type":"definition","display":"df-reed-solomon-code — Reed Solomon Evaluation Encoding","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 19.10","source_printed_pages":"383","source_pdf_pages":"409","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-reed-solomon-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-reed-solomon-code</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reed-solomon-code — Reed Solomon Evaluation Encoding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 19.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"383"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"409"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为有限域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\le m\\le|F|\">\\(n\\le m\\le|F|\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=(\\alpha_1,\\ldots,\\alpha_m)\\in F^m\">\\(\\alpha=(\\alpha_1,\\ldots,\\alpha_m)\\in F^m\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ne j\\Rightarrow\\alpha_i\\ne\\alpha_j\">\\(i\\ne j\\Rightarrow\\alpha_i\\ne\\alpha_j\\)</span>；它是编码的显式结构参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=(c_0,\\ldots,c_{n-1})\\in F^n\">\\(c=(c_0,\\ldots,c_{n-1})\\in F^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是形式不定元。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_c(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}c_iX^i\\in F[X].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_c(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}c_iX^i\\in F[X].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}:F^n\\to F^m,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}(c)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}c_i\\alpha_j^i\\right\\rangle_{j=1}^m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}:F^n\\to F^m,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}(c)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}c_i\\alpha_j^i\\right\\rangle_{j=1}^m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 19.10（印刷383页/PDF409页）把消息视为次数至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n-1\">\\(n-1\\)</span> 的单变量多项式系数，并在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 个不同域元素处求值。本节点显式保留求值点序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>；未把不同排序产生的坐标排列隐藏起来。常数项与零多项式均包含在公式中。有限域运算给出每个坐标唯一的值，故编码为全函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\le m\\le|F|","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=(\\alpha_1,\\ldots,\\alpha_m)\\in F^m","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ne j\\Rightarrow\\alpha_i\\ne\\alpha_j","display":false},{"tex":"c=(c_0,\\ldots,c_{n-1})\\in F^n","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"P_c(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}c_iX^i\\in F[X].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}:F^n\\to F^m,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}(c)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}c_i\\alpha_j^i\\right\\rangle_{j=1}^m.","display":true},{"tex":"n-1","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1410,"backlinks":[{"id":"2fa56b15b1b02b78","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F,n,m,\\alpha,\\operatorname{RS}_{F,n,\\alpha}$、$P_c$ 见 [[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-245","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第19章：硬度放大与纠错码：[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]、[[28-thm-yao-xor-lemma]]、[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]、[[28-prop-unique-decoding-radius]]、[[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]、[[28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction]]、[[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]、[[28-lem-reed-solomon-distance]]、[[28-prop-concatenated-code-distance]]、[[28-thm-binary-johnson-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}